  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of the Ancient Nabataean Flash Flood Protection System at Petra (Phase 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The dam on the Wadi al-Jarra is under threat of collapse from soil deposition and vegetation and no longer fulfills its original purpose of water retention. Phase 2 of this project involves the excavation and cleaning of the channel and basin, masonry consolidation, and the restoration of the dam to function as designed.</narrative>
  </description>
